{"unit_id": "tag:0074:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。对每个开集（open）<MATH_0002>，考虑<MATH_0003>代数（algebra）\n<MATHSEG_0001>连续（continuous）<MATHSEG_0002>。\n有显然的限制映射（restriction mappings），使这一构造成为一个预层（presheaf），取值为<MATH_0004>代数（algebras），定义在<MATH_0005>上。\n由例<REF_0001>，它是一个层（sheaf），取值为集合（sets）。\n因此，由引理<REF_0002>，它是一个层（sheaf），取值为<MATH_0006>代数（algebras），定义在<MATH_0007>上。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "给定空间所属的类型。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "此处作名词，指给定拓扑空间中的开集。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "在每个开集上考虑的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "定义该代数时对映射施加的条件。"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "使该构造成为预层的映射。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "由这些限制映射得到的结构。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "该预层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "由所引的例得到的层性质。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "应用所引的例时该层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "应用所引的引理后得到的结构。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "应用所引的引理后该层的取值类型。"}], "notes": []}
